    "inserts": [],
    "title": "Find complaints about lower-rated products",
    "commandWord": "Complete / Write / Describe",
    "reading": [
      "Use PRODUCT for the name and rating, and COMPLAINT for the complaint details. Include rating 5 and sort highest qualifying rating first."
    ],
    "solution": [
      {
        "type": "code",
        "text": "SELECT PRODUCT.ProductID, ProductName, ComplaintDetails\nFROM PRODUCT INNER JOIN COMPLAINT\nON PRODUCT.ProductID = COMPLAINT.ProductID\nWHERE Rating <= 5\nORDER BY Rating DESC;"
      },
      "One product can appear several times when it has several complaints. Rating controls filtering and ordering without needing to be an output column. No official sample rows are supplied, so any runnable sample data must be labelled teacher-written."
    ],
    "marking": [
      "One point each for the selected attributes, source tables, join, inclusive condition and descending order."
    ],
