    "title": "Protect access to customer data",
    "commandWord": "Complete / Write / Describe",
    "reading": [
      "Describe two distinct methods and explain how each protects the customer data."
    ],
    "solution": [
      "Authentication checks credentials before access is allowed. Access rights restrict which authenticated users may read or change particular data. Backups offer another valid approach when explained as recovery from loss or damage."
    ],
    "marking": [
      "One mark per method and one per corresponding explanation, up to four. Backups, encryption and views are alternatives accepted by the scheme."
    ],
