    "title": "Identify the keys that connect ships and containers",
    "commandWord": "Describe",
    "objectiveIds": [],
    "syllabusMapping": [
      "S8.02"
    ],
    "reading": [
      "Use the SHIP and CONTAINER definitions. State the relationship and identify both fields involved."
    ],
    "solution": [
      "SHIP has a one-to-many relationship with CONTAINER. SHIP.ShipID is the primary key; CONTAINER.ShipID is the foreign key that references it."
    ],
    "marking": [
      "One mark for the one-to-many relationship and one for identifying the primary and foreign keys correctly."
    ],
